    Assertion:a-pooled-track-survives,sentence:a pooled track survives a thin session as sediment in the very same draw — wanted and already pooled together mean silence not an evict
    Assertion:a-barred-track-never,sentence:a barred track never enters the draw at all — not chosen not diffed not evicted
    {"Assertion":"the-recent-compartment-presses","sentence":"the recent compartment presses what the shelf already holds and pulls what it does not, the same track never both"}
    Assertion:a-displacement-pulls-first,sentence:a displacement pulls first and evicts only once the replacement has landed — the pool never drops below its cap for a wish
    Assertion:a-pool-holding-more,sentence:a pool holding more than its goal trims at once — the window rations displacement not trimming
